# 75-12: CorporateForm (Corporate.form) + ContactForm (ContactForm) i18n
# namespaces, and the /contact page's details block (phone/email/location/
# availability/legal-entity labels) -- hand-translated in-session (D-08)
# into ru/es/fr/ar/hi/zh. Plan 75-18 applies this pattern to
# i18n/translation-manifest.json so a future pipeline run neither
# overwrites these units nor re-spends tokens on them.
messages/en.json::Corporate.form
messages/en.json::ContactForm
content/pages/en/contact.json::details
